    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CAROL: For God's sake, before someone breaks a leg or falls off a roof, let's go ring the doorbell, invite ourselves in for a neighborly chat, and …\nBONNIE: Okay!",
      "CAROL: Hi! Welcome to Hayfield Place! We're your new neighbors!\nBONNIE: We brought dessert. Is your mother home?",
      "CAROL: Why don't we make some coffee, Bonnie?\nBONNIE: Okay. Does everyone want cake?",
      "CAROL: Let's have some cake.\nBONNIE: Gee, this is a nice, big old house. I don't believe I was ever inside it when the Knapps lived here.",
      "BONNIE: Is it a burglar?\nCAROL: No. It's Art."
    ]
